@startuml
title Slice 2: 評価・ルーブリックの中核クラス図
caption ルーブリックの各段階、評価結果、根拠、再評価履歴を保存するモデル

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

note "削除方針\n- Rubric は rubricStatus=archived でアーカイブする\n- Criterion / Level は利用中の版から物理削除せず、必要な変更は新版で表す\n- Evaluation と根拠・得点・フィードバック・再評価履歴は追記型で通常削除しない\n- 保存期間対応は通常操作と分離した匿名化・物理削除手順で行う" as SoftDeletePolicy

class Rubric {
  + rubricId: Long <<PK>>
  + createdByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + title: String
  + version: String
  + rubricStatus: RubricStatus
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + updatedAt: DateTime
}

class RubricCriterion {
  + criterionId: Long <<PK>>
  + rubricId: Long <<FK>>
  + dimensionId: Long <<FK>>
  + criterionCode: String
  + name: String
  + description: Text
  + weight: Decimal
  + sortOrder: Integer
}

class CriterionLevel {
  + criterionLevelId: Long <<PK>>
  + criterionId: Long <<FK>>
  + levelValue: Integer
  + levelLabel: String
  + levelDescription: Text
}

class Evaluation {
  + evaluationId: Long <<PK>>
  + evaluationCode: String <<UK>>
  + submissionId: Long <<FK>>
  + rubricId: Long <<FK>>
  + promptVersionId: Long <<FK>>
  + evaluationStatus: EvaluationStatus
  + overallScore: Decimal
  + processAnalysis: LongText
  + feedbackSummary: Text
  + evaluationKind: EvaluationKind
  + formatVersion: String
  + locale: String
  + generatedAt: DateTime
  + finalEvaluatedAt: DateTime
  + autoSaveCount: Integer
  + executionCount: Integer
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + completedAt: DateTime
}

class RubricDimension {
  + dimensionId: Long <<PK>>
  + rubricId: Long <<FK>>
  + dimensionCode: String
  + label: String
  + scaleMinimum: Integer
  + scaleMaximum: Integer
  + scaleLabel: String
  + sortOrder: Integer
}

class EvaluationDimensionResult {
  + evaluationDimensionResultId: Long <<PK>>
  + evaluationId: Long <<FK>>
  + dimensionId: Long <<FK>>
  + scoreValue: Decimal
  + scoreText: String
  + summaryTitle: String
  + summaryDescription: Text
}

class EvaluationScore {
  + evaluationScoreId: Long <<PK>>
  + evaluationId: Long <<FK>>
  + criterionId: Long <<FK>>
  + criterionLevelId: Long <<FK>>
  + metricKey: String
  + dimensionId: Long <<FK>>
  + metricTitle: String
  + scoreValue: Integer
  + metricDescription: Text
}

class EvaluationReason {
  + evaluationReasonId: Long <<PK>>
  + evaluationId: Long <<FK>>
  + reasonCode: String
  + dimensionId: Long <<FK>>
  + categoryLabel: String
  + title: String
  + scoreValue: Integer
  + body: LongText
}

class EvaluationReasonDetail {
  + reasonDetailId: Long <<PK>>
  + evaluationReasonId: Long <<FK>>
  + detailCode: String
  + detailText: Text
  + sortOrder: Integer
}

class EvaluationEvidence {
  + evidenceId: Long <<PK>>
  + reasonDetailId: Long <<FK>>
  + codeLogId: Long <<FK>>
  + codeExecutionId: Long <<FK>>
  + evidenceType: String
  + evidenceLabel: String
  + sourceRecordType: String
  + sourceRecordId: String
  + evidenceValue: Text
  + evidenceUnit: String
  + codeRange: String
  + evidenceSummary: Text
}

class EvaluationFeedback {
  + feedbackId: Long <<PK>>
  + evaluationId: Long <<FK>>
  + feedbackType: FeedbackType
  + priority: FeedbackPriority
  + message: Text
  + createdAt: DateTime
}

class ReevaluationJob {
  + reevaluationJobId: Long <<PK>>
  + taskId: Long <<FK>>
  + promptVersionId: Long <<FK>>
  + requestedByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + reevaluationStatus: ReevaluationStatus
  + targetCount: Integer
  + completedCount: Integer
  + progressPercent: Decimal
  + resultSummary: JSON
  + startedAt: DateTime
  + completedAt: DateTime
}

class Submission {
  + submissionId: Long <<PK>>
  + participationId: Long <<FK>>
  + revisionNumber: Integer
  + submittedAt: DateTime
}

class CodeLog {
  + codeLogId: Long <<PK>>
  + participationId: Long <<FK>>
  + observedAt: DateTime
}

Rubric "1" -- "1..*" RubricCriterion
Rubric "1" -- "1..*" RubricDimension
RubricDimension "1" -- "1..*" RubricCriterion
RubricCriterion "1" -- "1..*" CriterionLevel
Rubric "1" -- "0..*" Evaluation : 評価時に版を固定
Submission "1" -- "0..*" Evaluation : 再評価履歴を保持
Evaluation "1" -- "1..*" EvaluationDimensionResult
RubricDimension "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationDimensionResult
Evaluation "1" -- "1..*" EvaluationScore
RubricCriterion "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationScore
CriterionLevel "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationScore
EvaluationScore "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationEvidence
Evaluation "1" -- "1..*" EvaluationReason
EvaluationReason "1" -- "1..*" EvaluationReasonDetail
EvaluationReasonDetail "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationEvidence
CodeLog "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationEvidence
Evaluation "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationFeedback
ReevaluationJob "1" -- "0..*" Evaluation : 対象結果

note right of Evaluation
  評価状態は not_started / in_progress /
  completed / failed / needs_revision を保持。
  旧結果を上書きせず再評価ごとに追加する。
end note

note bottom of RubricCriterion
  5段階などの評価段階と説明文も行として保存し、
  レベル定義を JSON や画面表示だけに閉じ込めない。
end note

@enduml
